WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.913
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.913 --> 00:00:12.343
SPEAKER: Suppose a child goes into
a store to buy a loaf of bread.

00:00:12.354 --> 00:00:16.748
The shopkeeper realizes that
she could shortchange the child,

00:00:16.748 --> 00:00:21.568
but she worries that if she did
so, other customers might find out,

00:00:21.568 --> 00:00:24.180
and she would lose business.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:28.137
So she decides to give the
child the correct change.

00:00:28.137 --> 00:00:33.250
Does the shopkeeper's
action have moral worth?

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:37.350
[MUSIC]

